WEBVTT

00:00:03.515 --> 00:00:06.051
Come on, two-abreast. Stay in line.

00:00:06.051 --> 00:00:06.751
No talking.

00:00:06.751 --> 00:00:07.619
NATIONAL ESP TEST
No talking.

00:00:07.619 --> 00:00:09.416
NATIONAL ESP TEST
The test will be over soon.

00:00:09.888 --> 00:00:11.823
Follow our instructions...

00:00:11.823 --> 00:00:14.314
and we may find something wonderful in you!

00:00:14.659 --> 00:00:17.856
Um, can I take your picture?

00:00:18.897 --> 00:00:20.231
The two of us...

00:00:20.231 --> 00:00:21.323
are public servants.

00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:24.029
Two photos apiece!

00:00:25.270 --> 00:00:26.999
Okay, next question.

00:00:27.639 --> 00:00:30.442
You see a snail crawling along a straight razor.

00:00:30.442 --> 00:00:32.844
You want to use the razor. What do you do?

00:00:32.844 --> 00:00:34.539
Even saying that...

00:00:34.779 --> 00:00:36.644
Just answer it.

00:00:36.748 --> 00:00:39.808
Well, I'd do nothing. The razor'd be all gross.

00:00:42.253 --> 00:00:46.324
Holy... Her power's off the
scale of all the equipment!

00:00:46.324 --> 00:00:50.628
So... You're a Level 2!
No special problems at all!

00:00:50.628 --> 00:00:52.230
Yay! Thank goodness!

00:00:52.230 --> 00:00:53.197
Next, please.

00:00:53.531 --> 00:00:54.429
Yes.

00:00:55.467 --> 00:00:56.695
Last question.

00:00:58.136 --> 00:01:00.171
You're dating that secretary, now?

00:01:00.171 --> 00:01:01.638
I'm asking the questions!

00:01:01.873 --> 00:01:04.239
But you know we're Level 7, right?

00:01:04.476 --> 00:01:07.579
And we need to examine
you to keep that a secret.

00:01:07.579 --> 00:01:09.672
Right, right. Even so...

00:01:09.948 --> 00:01:13.518
I wish I had psychokinesis.
Powerful enough to fly!

00:01:13.518 --> 00:01:16.988
Forget it. You couldn't do that unless
you were at least a Level 6.

00:01:16.988 --> 00:01:19.524
Only 2 or 3 people out of a hundred are espers.

00:01:19.524 --> 00:01:21.253
And most of them are below Level 2.

00:01:21.760 --> 00:01:23.261
Is it like this every year?

00:01:23.261 --> 00:01:27.399
Pretty much. It's natural for kids to want ESP.

00:01:27.399 --> 00:01:30.769
Even so, but everyone's scared
of strangers who have them.

00:01:30.769 --> 00:01:32.637
Scared, huh?

00:01:32.637 --> 00:01:34.305
Dr. Sakaki, can I have a moment?

00:01:34.305 --> 00:01:36.170
What's up, Dr. Minamoto?

00:01:36.741 --> 00:01:38.800
There's a child giving me
some troubling readings.

00:01:39.310 --> 00:01:42.006
Gotcha. Take over here, then.

00:01:42.580 --> 00:01:45.947
Also, how'd Kaoru's test go?

00:01:46.317 --> 00:01:48.720
Huh? Pretty normal.

00:01:48.720 --> 00:01:53.525
I see. She 's looked awfully moody lately.

00:01:53.525 --> 00:01:55.390
You think it's over what happened with Carry?

00:01:55.493 --> 00:01:56.227
Yeah.

00:01:56.227 --> 00:01:58.930
It's okay. It's natural for her to be shocked...

00:01:58.930 --> 00:02:01.364
over how Carry didn't get a happy ending.

00:02:01.633 --> 00:02:03.635
Stay out of private conversations!

00:02:03.635 --> 00:02:07.138
Even so, she's been really distant.

00:02:07.138 --> 00:02:09.834
Move it! We're getting backed up out here!

00:02:10.475 --> 00:02:17.574
Strongly, gallantly, I beat my wings

00:02:18.583 --> 00:02:24.453
Zettai Karen Children

00:02:26.891 --> 00:02:32.693
Meeting you like I did

00:02:33.031 --> 00:02:37.900
Wasn't just so we could live

00:02:39.170 --> 00:02:44.699
Tiny wishes, cross through time

00:02:45.110 --> 00:02:49.706
And surely change the future

00:02:50.315 --> 00:02:53.218
When my limiter (changing myself)

00:02:53.218 --> 00:02:56.346
Is released (changing yourself)

00:02:56.488 --> 00:03:02.222
An angel's shining surges through me

00:03:03.661 --> 00:03:06.231
The "wings" that will save the world

00:03:06.231 --> 00:03:09.064
Now I'm on the path I chose

00:03:09.300 --> 00:03:15.466
And I want to grab my dreams (Can't stop)

00:03:15.607 --> 00:03:18.409
The power given to me

00:03:18.409 --> 00:03:21.045
Spurs me into the sky

00:03:21.045 --> 00:03:26.779
Strongly, gallantly, I beat my wings

00:03:27.118 --> 00:03:32.647
Absolutely lovely, my wings

00:03:40.698 --> 00:03:42.825
45th sense:
"Natural Talents are Natural! Gift of Children"

00:03:44.002 --> 00:03:45.670
Level 2, huh?

00:03:45.670 --> 00:03:48.696
Never stronger, never weaker.
Just kinda half-baked.

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:51.843
Ever think about which you'd like to see happen?

00:03:51.843 --> 00:03:53.811
Which would you prefer, Chisato?

00:03:55.313 --> 00:03:58.510
It might be nice to be totally normal
and not have any troubles, but...

00:03:59.017 --> 00:04:04.080
but if I could develop to a Level 7
and become a special esper,

00:04:05.390 --> 00:04:07.358
that might be fun, too.

00:04:07.358 --> 00:04:10.528
Actually, that's a real pain, too...

00:04:10.528 --> 00:04:13.964
Yeah! That might be a lot of fun! Right, Kaoru?

00:04:22.440 --> 00:04:26.570
Maybe having ESP means never being happy...

00:04:33.051 --> 00:04:35.542
Sorry, Chisato! We've got urgent business!

00:04:35.887 --> 00:04:37.355
Okay. Bye!

00:04:37.355 --> 00:04:39.823
Whoa! That's fast! Wonder what's so urgent.

00:04:41.926 --> 00:04:42.794
Him?

00:04:42.794 --> 00:04:46.931
Yeah. Takeshi Kawamura.
He's in third grade at your school.

00:04:46.931 --> 00:04:49.267
This isn't an actual mission, but...

00:04:49.267 --> 00:04:52.896
We want you to watch him.
We have clearance from the chief.

00:04:53.037 --> 00:04:54.405
Why him?

00:04:54.405 --> 00:04:57.108
His ESP test results show a high probability...

00:04:57.108 --> 00:05:00.745
that he's a latent esper whose
powers are about to awaken.

00:05:00.745 --> 00:05:04.681
His latent powers are estimated
to be between Level 4 to Level 6.

00:05:05.350 --> 00:05:07.118
That can be dangerous, right?

00:05:07.118 --> 00:05:11.923
He could also manifest several strong
powers immediately after awakening.

00:05:11.923 --> 00:05:14.721
I want you to follow him,
just in case anything happens.

00:05:14.859 --> 00:05:15.827
Secretly?

00:05:15.827 --> 00:05:17.562
That'd be best, if you can do it.

00:05:17.562 --> 00:05:18.796
Roger!

00:05:18.796 --> 00:05:20.855
Just keep this in mind.

00:05:21.299 --> 00:05:25.793
You aren't watching him because
he's a dangerous monster.

00:05:26.271 --> 00:05:30.799
If he does turn out to be an esper,
we want him to have a peaceful life.

00:05:31.042 --> 00:05:32.043
Minamoto...

00:05:32.043 --> 00:05:34.169
Mr. Minamoto.

00:05:35.246 --> 00:05:37.548
Okay, Minamoto! Release us!

00:05:37.548 --> 00:05:38.037
Right!

00:05:38.750 --> 00:05:41.048
The Children, released!

00:05:41.819 --> 00:05:42.308
<<RELEASED>>

00:05:42.620 --> 00:05:44.144
National ESP Test RETEST NOTICE
A retest, huh?

00:05:44.856 --> 00:05:46.557
Why me?

00:05:46.557 --> 00:05:47.148
Yo!

00:05:48.092 --> 00:05:49.027
Hello!

00:05:49.027 --> 00:05:50.927
Are you Takeshi Kawamura?

00:05:54.299 --> 00:05:55.033
What?

00:05:55.033 --> 00:05:56.301
Is he already?!

00:05:56.301 --> 00:05:57.325
Oh, no!

00:05:57.535 --> 00:05:58.934
Who...

00:06:00.338 --> 00:06:01.600
Who are you?!

00:06:03.441 --> 00:06:06.274
Those girls! I said secretly!

00:06:06.744 --> 00:06:10.441
Aside from that,
shouldn't you have mentioned it?

00:06:11.349 --> 00:06:14.512
It... It's just that Kaoru seems so distant now...

00:06:15.086 --> 00:06:19.457
Not about Kaoru. Didn't you look at the file?

00:06:19.457 --> 00:06:22.517
That kid's dad is a supporter
of the Normal People.

00:06:22.860 --> 00:06:24.329
Yeah, I know.

00:06:24.329 --> 00:06:25.318
So, why didn't you tell them?

00:06:25.530 --> 00:06:28.465
It's why I asked The Children to do this.

00:06:28.900 --> 00:06:32.267
It'll be okay. I know they can make this work.

00:06:33.304 --> 00:06:34.939
You're all espers?

00:06:34.939 --> 00:06:37.642
Yeah, Level 7... I mean, 2!

00:06:37.642 --> 00:06:41.012
A teacher asked us to talk to you.

00:06:41.012 --> 00:06:42.213
So, anyway...

00:06:42.213 --> 00:06:43.348
Nice to meet you!

00:06:43.348 --> 00:06:47.485
The thing is, they're not sure
if I'm an esper or not.

00:06:47.485 --> 00:06:48.816
Doesn't something seem weird here?

00:06:49.721 --> 00:06:51.356
W-Well...

00:06:51.356 --> 00:06:53.051
Would tailing him have
been that much of a pain?

00:06:54.459 --> 00:06:56.327
But you should be happy to have...

00:06:56.327 --> 00:06:59.764
three such pretty and cute
big sisters to come meet you!

00:06:59.764 --> 00:07:02.800
Right! So don't sweat the details!

00:07:02.800 --> 00:07:06.037
Let's have fun! Party of one, this way, please!

00:07:06.037 --> 00:07:10.804
All we have is 3,800 yen.
It's like we're pulling him into a clip-joint.

00:07:11.843 --> 00:07:15.113
So, your mom and dad are
Normals and they both work?

00:07:15.113 --> 00:07:17.809
Yeah. They both teach at the university.

00:07:19.450 --> 00:07:22.854
So, what kind of powers do you want, Takeshi?

00:07:22.854 --> 00:07:23.786
Powers?

00:07:23.921 --> 00:07:26.151
For example... Psychokinesis!

00:07:28.159 --> 00:07:29.820
Or maybe psychometry?

00:07:32.230 --> 00:07:34.721
Wow. You practice your swing
a hundred times a day?

00:07:34.999 --> 00:07:36.334
How did you know?!

00:07:36.334 --> 00:07:37.824
Or maybe teleportation!

00:07:39.170 --> 00:07:44.073
Check it out! You can levitate your body and fly!

00:07:50.148 --> 00:07:53.050
The ESP reading nearby them is rising!

00:07:53.050 --> 00:07:56.508
Are they trying to stimulate
his powers to awaken?

00:07:57.355 --> 00:07:58.256
What's wrong?

00:07:58.256 --> 00:07:59.382
Someone's come home!

00:08:02.026 --> 00:08:03.628
Welcome home, Father!

00:08:03.628 --> 00:08:04.629
Friends?

00:08:04.629 --> 00:08:06.197
Hello!

00:08:06.197 --> 00:08:07.789
Um, well...

00:08:12.036 --> 00:08:14.766
ESP limiters... Espers?

00:08:17.408 --> 00:08:18.109
But...

00:08:18.109 --> 00:08:22.079
Takeshi, you have homework. End this at once.

00:08:22.079 --> 00:08:23.910
Huh? Father, wait!

00:08:26.083 --> 00:08:28.119
Kinda cold, huh?

00:08:28.119 --> 00:08:31.247
It's not like we made a bad first impression...

00:08:35.059 --> 00:08:37.857
"ESP Is Destroying the World!"

00:08:37.929 --> 00:08:39.430
Wh-When did?!

00:08:39.430 --> 00:08:41.830
Oh, man. Your dad wrote this?

00:08:42.066 --> 00:08:46.871
"ESP can only break down traditional society.

00:08:46.871 --> 00:08:50.068
"They have a negative impact
on the lives of Normals..."

00:08:50.308 --> 00:08:53.038
Wow. Pretty mean stuff inside that thing.

00:08:55.079 --> 00:08:58.816
I'm gonna beat every last word back into him!

00:08:58.816 --> 00:08:59.450
Stop that!

00:08:59.450 --> 00:08:59.851
Leggo! But! But!
Stop that!

00:08:59.851 --> 00:09:01.786
Leggo! But! But!
You'll just make things worse!

00:09:01.786 --> 00:09:06.655
Even if he becomes an esper,
look at what his dad's like!

00:09:08.726 --> 00:09:09.861
Kaoru!

00:09:09.861 --> 00:09:11.829
Don't be such a baby!

00:09:11.829 --> 00:09:13.297
It wasn't me!

00:09:13.297 --> 00:09:14.195
Which means...

00:09:17.101 --> 00:09:18.534
Me?!

00:09:19.537 --> 00:09:20.204
Ah! His ESP's activated!

00:09:20.204 --> 00:09:22.006
Yeah, it's me. Where are we meeting tonight?
Sorry, can't make it.
Ah! His ESP's activated!

00:09:22.006 --> 00:09:24.642
Yeah, it's me. Where are we meeting tonight?
Sorry, can't make it.
Sakaki, hurry up and...

00:09:24.642 --> 00:09:27.372
No personal calls during a mission!

00:09:27.678 --> 00:09:30.476
Um, I need to make three more, or I'm in trouble!

00:09:30.982 --> 00:09:33.417
Come on, try to do it again!

00:09:33.417 --> 00:09:34.819
B-But...

00:09:34.819 --> 00:09:38.311
It's okay! Your core ESP power is activating!

00:09:38.756 --> 00:09:42.360
Try this. Imagine opening
a hole over your head...

00:09:42.360 --> 00:09:46.763
and lowering it so that your body slips inside.

00:09:47.832 --> 00:09:49.857
Slip in?

00:09:52.270 --> 00:09:54.033
He did it!

00:09:54.539 --> 00:09:57.235
This is my ESP?!

00:09:59.076 --> 00:10:00.771
I'm falling!

00:10:00.878 --> 00:10:03.938
Check it out! You can levitate your body and fly!

00:10:04.181 --> 00:10:06.615
Stop! Stop! Stop! Stop! Stop! Stop! Stop!

00:10:18.796 --> 00:10:20.932
Ow...

00:10:20.932 --> 00:10:23.594
This is my?

00:10:25.303 --> 00:10:26.437
AWESOME!

00:10:26.437 --> 00:10:27.802
Now I'll be an esper!

00:10:28.039 --> 00:10:31.031
What?! You lost him? Is he all right?

00:10:31.208 --> 00:10:34.143
He levitated his body just before impact.

00:10:34.278 --> 00:10:35.279
He what?

00:10:35.279 --> 00:10:37.848
I wouldn't have thought he'd
slip past The Children.

00:10:37.848 --> 00:10:40.818
But he can't maintain that level
of power for even an hour!

00:10:40.818 --> 00:10:43.082
If we don't find him and get him into
protection, it could be dangerous!

00:10:43.321 --> 00:10:47.155
Calm down! Didn't you say we
should leave this to the girls?

00:10:47.758 --> 00:10:50.528
Even so, you could guess what a child...

00:10:50.528 --> 00:10:53.831
suddenly given powerful esper abilities might do.

00:10:53.831 --> 00:10:55.199
Wh-What?

00:10:55.199 --> 00:10:57.167
Think about it.

00:10:58.069 --> 00:11:00.004
Sort the large trash...

00:11:00.004 --> 00:11:01.301
Clean his room...

00:11:01.472 --> 00:11:02.632
God, you're lame.

00:11:03.040 --> 00:11:05.008
I have a feeling I know where he is.

00:11:07.411 --> 00:11:09.845
If I'm a capybara, then you're asparagus!

00:11:10.514 --> 00:11:13.884
I'm sorry! I don't understand!

00:11:13.884 --> 00:11:14.976
What?!

00:11:16.921 --> 00:11:17.717
Stop it!

00:11:17.888 --> 00:11:21.824
Huh?! Well, if it isn't Takeshi. You want some?

00:11:22.193 --> 00:11:23.626
Whoa! I feel all prickly!

00:11:26.530 --> 00:11:28.498
Wh-What the heck?

00:11:29.400 --> 00:11:31.868
You can't bully me anymore!

00:11:32.803 --> 00:11:35.897
You... You can just straight up fight me now?

00:11:36.240 --> 00:11:39.610
Take this! I'll turn you into a puddle of grease!

00:11:39.610 --> 00:11:40.804
Don't get carried away!

00:11:42.113 --> 00:11:45.276
How dare you injure my noble face!

00:11:45.750 --> 00:11:50.121
Great, he's awakened and now he
thinks he's a Planet Soldier!

00:11:50.121 --> 00:11:52.890
He's on a high from suddenly
getting powers like this.

00:11:52.890 --> 00:11:56.861
Powers... As in... ESP?!

00:11:56.861 --> 00:11:57.987
He's an esper?

00:11:58.329 --> 00:12:01.856
Stay out of this! I hate how he bullies everyone!

00:12:03.100 --> 00:12:04.829
Don't hurt us!

00:12:05.436 --> 00:12:08.639
Wait! I wanted to save you.

00:12:08.639 --> 00:12:09.540
Run!

00:12:09.540 --> 00:12:10.905
Yeah!

00:12:11.542 --> 00:12:12.043
Run!

00:12:12.043 --> 00:12:13.411
Why? I'm the bad guy here?
Run!

00:12:13.411 --> 00:12:15.038
Why? I'm the bad guy here?

00:12:15.279 --> 00:12:20.084
Well, duh! You don't use ESP
for a stupid kid's fight!

00:12:20.084 --> 00:12:21.813
Of course they'll hate you!

00:12:21.986 --> 00:12:23.578
Hah! Like I care!

00:12:23.654 --> 00:12:25.956
You should listen to your sempai!

00:12:25.956 --> 00:12:26.957
Sempai?

00:12:26.957 --> 00:12:30.085
I don't have to take that from
a bunch of Level 2's!

00:12:32.897 --> 00:12:33.955
Stop it!

00:12:34.131 --> 00:12:36.793
You're not Level 2's...

00:12:37.635 --> 00:12:38.966
Interesting.

00:12:39.203 --> 00:12:41.872
Who knows how powerful
I'll get if I go all-out on you!

00:12:41.872 --> 00:12:43.169
Let's see!

00:12:44.275 --> 00:12:45.105
Kaoru!

00:12:48.312 --> 00:12:49.779
You!

00:12:52.717 --> 00:12:54.810
Financial crisis!

00:12:56.087 --> 00:12:56.815
Noble!

00:12:56.921 --> 00:12:57.488
Righteous!

00:12:57.488 --> 00:12:58.522
Beautiful!

00:12:58.522 --> 00:12:59.819
That's us!

00:13:00.157 --> 00:13:01.859
The preparations are complete.

00:13:01.859 --> 00:13:04.228
With this, we can pay back...

00:13:04.228 --> 00:13:09.256
the filthy espers who threaten
the order of our world!

00:13:10.935 --> 00:13:13.738
What's the matter?! Can't beat me?!

00:13:13.738 --> 00:13:14.672
Kaoru!

00:13:14.672 --> 00:13:15.840
Fine.

00:13:15.840 --> 00:13:19.901
You asked for it, now we'll
show you what we can really do!

00:13:27.351 --> 00:13:29.620
Between espers and Normals...

00:13:29.620 --> 00:13:31.856
a little cold rain will fall!

00:13:31.856 --> 00:13:34.458
If you can sympathize, then give us a limiter!

00:13:34.458 --> 00:13:36.358
The Absolutely Lovely Children!

00:13:37.628 --> 00:13:40.062
Those clothes... You're special espers.

00:13:40.498 --> 00:13:42.227
Now I get it.

00:13:43.167 --> 00:13:45.803
Meaning, if I show you how good I am,

00:13:45.803 --> 00:13:48.271
I'll get to work for BABEL, right?

00:13:48.906 --> 00:13:50.407
Careful, Kaoru!

00:13:50.407 --> 00:13:53.077
He's not going to hold back!

00:13:53.077 --> 00:13:56.380
I know. I'm not letting this idiot do as he likes!

00:13:56.380 --> 00:13:57.347
What?!

00:14:01.118 --> 00:14:04.918
You're pretty powerful. However...

00:14:06.757 --> 00:14:08.987
You're fighting the wrong people!

00:14:09.193 --> 00:14:10.888
What do you mean?

00:14:13.230 --> 00:14:16.534
I'm saying there's someone else
you want to acknowledge you!

00:14:16.534 --> 00:14:20.368
Do you really want us or your friends
to tell you how great you are?

00:14:21.572 --> 00:14:25.508
Why do you think you're trying so hard,
using your powers to make your case?

00:14:27.044 --> 00:14:28.102
That's...

00:14:29.180 --> 00:14:31.682
Those kids... What are they doing?

00:14:31.682 --> 00:14:32.910
Stop...

00:14:35.719 --> 00:14:37.021
What?!

00:14:37.021 --> 00:14:37.817
The ship!

00:14:40.724 --> 00:14:42.493
Uh-oh! The bridge is collapsing!

00:14:42.493 --> 00:14:42.959
Huh?

00:14:45.663 --> 00:14:47.130
I'll hold it up!

00:14:47.631 --> 00:14:51.863
Aoi! Shiho! Get those people
off the bridge while I do!

00:14:52.236 --> 00:14:53.328
Roger!

00:14:54.438 --> 00:14:58.465
But what's such a huge ship
doing in this little river?!

00:15:00.244 --> 00:15:00.911
Yes?

00:15:00.911 --> 00:15:03.709
Minamoto, we have an emergency!
Turn on the news!

00:15:04.281 --> 00:15:07.751
Several espers are running amuck
at the Oedogawa River estuary.

00:15:07.751 --> 00:15:10.242
Several Normals appear to
be caught in the middle, as well.

00:15:10.721 --> 00:15:12.189
We have reports that the ship was taken
over by espers and piloted into the river,
Espers hijacked the ship?

00:15:12.189 --> 00:15:15.526
We have reports that the ship was taken
over by espers and piloted into the river,
Precog division had no predictions
of any esper crimes!

00:15:15.526 --> 00:15:17.187
but no details as yet.
What's going on here?

00:15:17.995 --> 00:15:20.429
We appear to have a camera on the scene now.

00:15:20.764 --> 00:15:24.034
Espers? But what would they be after?

00:15:24.034 --> 00:15:27.271
No, look closely. At the ship's crew.

00:15:27.271 --> 00:15:28.465
The Normal People!

00:15:28.606 --> 00:15:31.006
What the hell are they up to?!

00:15:33.744 --> 00:15:36.547
We'll teleport them to somewhere safe for now!

00:15:36.547 --> 00:15:37.946
Forget about the cars!

00:15:46.390 --> 00:15:46.981
What?

00:15:51.028 --> 00:15:52.630
Hurry! The people inside!

00:15:52.630 --> 00:15:54.154
I know!

00:15:58.035 --> 00:16:00.595
We've gotten video of the espers running amuck!

00:16:00.938 --> 00:16:04.066
Espers are definitely involved in this.
You idiot, they're rescuing people!

00:16:04.408 --> 00:16:07.177
With us for analysis is Toutou University...

00:16:07.177 --> 00:16:09.509
assistant professor Takenori Kawamura.

00:16:10.514 --> 00:16:11.481
Takeshi's!

00:16:11.815 --> 00:16:16.420
This is the sort of incident you'd expect
when espers are left at large.

00:16:16.420 --> 00:16:17.755
As I wrote in my book,

00:16:17.755 --> 00:16:19.056
Not good. This is just going to
spread anti-esper sentiment!
As I wrote in my book,

00:16:19.056 --> 00:16:22.719
Not good. This is just going to
spread anti-esper sentiment!
espers are our greatest enemies, bar none!

00:16:22.893 --> 00:16:25.862
Exactly! You have to capture them at once!

00:16:26.130 --> 00:16:29.429
Understood. I'll go to the TV network
and explain the situation.

00:16:29.800 --> 00:16:32.136
But what about The Children in the meantime?

00:16:32.136 --> 00:16:35.537
Don't worry! I trust those girls!

00:16:35.973 --> 00:16:39.710
We'll dispatch a special unit immediately!
Rendezvous with them!

00:16:39.710 --> 00:16:40.472
Go to it!

00:16:45.549 --> 00:16:46.417
The oil!

00:16:46.417 --> 00:16:47.618
Kaoru!

00:16:47.618 --> 00:16:49.984
Forget it! The bridge is
taking everything I've got!

00:16:51.255 --> 00:16:52.085
What do we do?

00:16:56.160 --> 00:16:58.929
I'll hold it up!

00:16:58.929 --> 00:17:01.532
But how long will your powers hold out?!

00:17:01.532 --> 00:17:02.658
So, hurry!

00:17:02.733 --> 00:17:03.324
Gotcha!

00:17:04.201 --> 00:17:06.465
Since one side looks like it's about to catch fire...

00:17:06.704 --> 00:17:09.673
PSYCHIC FLYING THROW!

00:17:12.009 --> 00:17:13.210
She threw them!

00:17:13.210 --> 00:17:14.244
They're falling!

00:17:14.244 --> 00:17:15.479
Exploding!

00:17:15.479 --> 00:17:17.470
Threatening nearby houses!
Mr. Kawamura, please calm down.

00:17:17.915 --> 00:17:19.314
There's another esper there, too.

00:17:20.551 --> 00:17:22.720
T-Takeshi?

00:17:22.720 --> 00:17:23.988
What's the meaning of this? Stop it!

00:17:23.988 --> 00:17:24.788
Mr. Kawamura, please! We're broadcasting!
What's the meaning of this? Stop it!

00:17:24.788 --> 00:17:26.457
Mr. Kawamura, please! We're broadcasting!
There must be some mistake!

00:17:26.457 --> 00:17:28.152
There must be some mistake!

00:17:29.426 --> 00:17:30.694
Mr. Kawamura?

00:17:30.694 --> 00:17:32.162
Who are you?

00:17:32.162 --> 00:17:34.790
I'm with BABEL. Please come with me.

00:17:36.700 --> 00:17:40.337
I never expected real special espers to show up.

00:17:40.337 --> 00:17:45.142
If we send out our fake espers
with this holographic projector...

00:17:45.142 --> 00:17:48.846
It'll look like a riot of rampaging espers.

00:17:48.846 --> 00:17:50.507
I see.

00:17:50.814 --> 00:17:53.017
You've been up to all kinds of nasty tricks, huh?

00:17:53.017 --> 00:17:53.711
Who?!

00:17:53.951 --> 00:17:57.409
Since you had to make a big mess,
I had to cancel four dates!

00:17:58.789 --> 00:18:00.586
You're gonna pay for that.

00:18:01.392 --> 00:18:02.393
In that case...

00:18:02.393 --> 00:18:04.190
Whoops! No, you don't!

00:18:10.467 --> 00:18:12.435
Just accept it.

00:18:13.437 --> 00:18:15.769
Impossible. My son can't be an esper!

00:18:16.106 --> 00:18:20.236
Even Normal parents can
carry the genes for ESP.

00:18:20.511 --> 00:18:25.039
You... You must be joking.
This horrible thing!

00:18:30.020 --> 00:18:32.589
That's the way! One more and I'm done!

00:18:32.589 --> 00:18:33.757
Hang in there!

00:18:33.757 --> 00:18:35.190
It's almost over, Takeshi!

00:18:39.663 --> 00:18:40.891
T-Takeshi.

00:18:41.865 --> 00:18:43.856
It's okay.

00:18:44.268 --> 00:18:46.203
He's just helping us deal with this accident.

00:18:46.203 --> 00:18:49.172
Zero casualties, thanks to Takeshi.

00:18:53.577 --> 00:18:58.115
With him holding the bridge up,
we could concentrate on rescue operations.

00:18:58.115 --> 00:18:59.013
He...

00:18:59.416 --> 00:19:02.317
Mr. Kawamura, why not try seeing it this way?

00:19:03.020 --> 00:19:05.456
Even if you don't like them,

00:19:05.456 --> 00:19:09.324
Takeshi's talents are a gift. A gift from God.

00:19:09.827 --> 00:19:13.456
Without that blessing, things would
have turned out much worse.

00:19:14.031 --> 00:19:17.865
Surely there must be some meaning for
him to have been given these powers.

00:19:23.207 --> 00:19:24.538
Okay, you can stop.

00:19:26.043 --> 00:19:27.444
I'm beat.

00:19:27.444 --> 00:19:28.412
You did your best.

00:19:28.412 --> 00:19:29.613
And you did great.

00:19:29.613 --> 00:19:30.511
Good job.

00:19:42.426 --> 00:19:46.362
In the end, Takeshi's power settled
down as psychokinesis.

00:19:46.463 --> 00:19:49.566
So, what's with the tea table
in the interview room?

00:19:49.566 --> 00:19:54.299
Something the father can safely
overturn in case he gets angry.

00:19:54.471 --> 00:19:56.666
It's all made from special materials!

00:19:56.907 --> 00:19:58.509
This is why taxes are so high.

00:19:58.509 --> 00:20:02.878
But, if his dad flips that table over, then...

00:20:03.614 --> 00:20:04.308
I...

00:20:05.215 --> 00:20:05.916
Kaoru.

00:20:05.916 --> 00:20:08.285
Up till now, I've warned of the dangers...

00:20:08.285 --> 00:20:11.622
of the spread of espers from
the standpoint of a Normal.

00:20:11.622 --> 00:20:13.924
I was protecting my family and society.

00:20:13.924 --> 00:20:14.625
Here it comes!

00:20:14.625 --> 00:20:15.216
Uh-oh!

00:20:15.526 --> 00:20:19.462
And now... My own son is!

00:20:20.097 --> 00:20:21.865
Please calm down!

00:20:21.865 --> 00:20:25.028
I can't live at home anymore, can I?

00:20:27.838 --> 00:20:28.772
He threw his book!

00:20:28.772 --> 00:20:29.973
And he's stepping on it!

00:20:29.973 --> 00:20:31.133
What's going on?

00:20:31.308 --> 00:20:33.640
But now I see it differently!

00:20:34.244 --> 00:20:37.181
From now on, instead of
seeing things as a Normal,

00:20:37.181 --> 00:20:39.483
I'll see them as protecting my family!

00:20:39.483 --> 00:20:40.279
Father!

00:20:41.084 --> 00:20:43.644
Typical doting parent...

00:20:44.254 --> 00:20:48.816
Please take care of my son!
Please develop his powers!

00:20:52.696 --> 00:20:53.754
Thank goodness.

00:20:55.766 --> 00:20:59.269
Starting with the Normal People,

00:20:59.269 --> 00:20:59.870
anti-esper groups are the enemies of society.

00:20:59.870 --> 00:21:01.738
So, he ended up following in Kaoru's footsteps.
anti-esper groups are the enemies of society.

00:21:01.738 --> 00:21:03.106
I wish his teleportation skills
had developed instead.
anti-esper groups are the enemies of society.

00:21:03.106 --> 00:21:03.707
I wish his teleportation skills
had developed instead.
Esper powers are a blessing from
heaven! A gift from God!

00:21:03.707 --> 00:21:03.941
Esper powers are a blessing from
heaven! A gift from God!

00:21:03.941 --> 00:21:07.240
Even so, look how much his dad's changed.
Esper powers are a blessing from
heaven! A gift from God!

00:21:08.178 --> 00:21:12.512
I wonder if our powers are a
blessing to someone, too?

00:21:13.717 --> 00:21:15.185
Of course they are.

00:21:15.185 --> 00:21:18.555
They are to your families. And to me.

00:21:18.555 --> 00:21:19.419
Minamoto.

00:21:19.690 --> 00:21:22.750
I love your abilities.

00:21:23.060 --> 00:21:26.552
Oh, not when you're in a bad mood, though!

00:21:27.030 --> 00:21:28.190
Minamoto!

00:21:29.032 --> 00:21:30.367
What's this?

00:21:30.367 --> 00:21:32.703
A present, from us three.

00:21:32.703 --> 00:21:33.795
It's Valentine's Day.

00:21:34.104 --> 00:21:35.833
Oh. That's right.

00:21:39.009 --> 00:21:41.239
You girls... Thank you.

00:21:41.545 --> 00:21:43.313
Aw... You must be happy to have...

00:21:43.313 --> 00:21:45.873
someone say they love you on Valentine's night.

00:21:46.617 --> 00:21:49.453
It's too soon for you to propose to us, you perv!

00:21:49.453 --> 00:21:51.288
That's kind of a big leap you're making there!

00:21:51.288 --> 00:21:53.090
Aw, be honest, now.

00:21:53.090 --> 00:21:55.251
I'd like to have two children!

00:21:56.226 --> 00:21:58.456
How does it always end up like this?!

00:22:00.464 --> 00:22:04.059
Okay, now for a wonderful
Valentine's date with...

00:22:06.270 --> 00:22:09.831
Uh-oh! I triple booked!

00:22:20.817 --> 00:22:24.421
I turn to the front, embracing the dream

00:22:24.421 --> 00:22:28.392
Making up my mind, looking up to the sky

00:22:28.392 --> 00:22:34.464
I'll fly beyond the future with my wings

00:22:34.464 --> 00:22:38.368
You alone are my heart's desire!

00:22:38.368 --> 00:22:42.306
I declared that I love you absolutely

00:22:42.306 --> 00:22:48.211
As the shining seasons pass

00:22:48.945 --> 00:22:52.983
Your face is still as troubled as in

00:22:52.983 --> 00:22:56.885
The photos I took to remember those days

00:22:57.487 --> 00:23:03.687
As I shed warm, gentle tears

00:23:04.928 --> 00:23:08.498
Let's try to meet here tomorrow, too

00:23:08.498 --> 00:23:12.069
Without making promises, let's go

00:23:12.069 --> 00:23:16.006
As casually as always

00:23:16.006 --> 00:23:21.239
Waving my little hand with a smile

00:23:22.279 --> 00:23:27.080
"Bye bye, till we meet again"

